This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses SLSA (Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts), version 1.2, as a
grounded IDD graph so consuming projects can compose it with throughline.

SLSA is a project of the Open Source Security Foundation (OpenSSF), a Linux Foundation
project, published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0). The requirement text reproduced here in items' text/rationale/attrs.source_ref
is derived from the SLSA specification and remains the work of the OpenSSF and its
contributors; this repository claims no ownership over that content and reproduces it,
under CC BY 4.0, for interoperability. See https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/ for the
authoritative source.
